<view class="history-page"><image class="history-bg" src="/images/runtime/team-data-emerald-stadium-v1.jpg" mode="aspectFill"/><view class="history-content"><view class="history-nav"><text class="history-back" bindtap="back">‹</text><text>历史参赛记录</text></view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="history-loading">正在读取赛事归档快照…</view><block wx:else><view class="history-hero"><image src="{{team.logo}}" mode="aspectFit"/><view><text>{{team.name}}</text><text>历史参赛 {{historyCount}} 项</text></view></view><view class="history-panel"><view class="history-tabs"><text wx:for="{{tabs}}" wx:key="id" data-tab="{{item.id}}" bindtap="switchTab" class="{{item.className}}">{{item.label}}</text></view><view wx:if="{{!hasVisibleItems}}" class="history-empty">暂无符合条件的历史参赛归档</view><view wx:for="{{visibleItems}}" wx:key="id" class="history-card"><view class="history-head"><image src="/images/runtime/icons/brand-v2-02.png" mode="aspectFit"/><view><text>{{item.name}}</text><view><text>{{item.divisionName}}</text><text>{{item.dateText}}</text></view></view><text class="history-arrow">›</text></view><view class="history-line"></view><view class="history-stats"><view><text>成绩</text><text class="{{item.resultClass}}">{{item.resultText}}</text></view><view><text>战绩</text><text>{{item.recordText}}</text></view><button data-item="{{item}}" bindtap="openArchive">查看归档</button></view></view></view><view class="history-notice"><image src="/images/runtime/icons/brand-v2-09.png" mode="aspectFit"/><text>历史参赛记录为赛事归档快照，不受球队日常资料修改影响。</text></view></block></view></view>
